consume the aggregation and include reliability section in report.\n\nLet me check the benefit eval report currently. It writes report.json and report.md. The objective says \"E01 在 Agent Dev benefit 报告里加入确定性的 pass^k、逐 trial 成功率、flake 与正反锚点聚合\". So I need to modify scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs to include reliability aggregation.\n\nLet me first look at the full o01-acceptance.json to model the acceptance file. It's 40k, big. Let me look at key parts.\n\nLet me also check the credential scan convention and how E01-SHA256SUMS should look. The O02-SHA256SUMS uses `<sha256>  <path>` format.\n\nLet me check node availability first and read o01-acceptance.json structure.\n\nLet me batch: node version, harness/package.json, o01-acceptance.json sections.\n\nActually, let me spawn subagents? The task says the user did not ask for subagents. I'll do it myself.\n\nLet me continue exploring."}}
